@startuml
title 03. Shopify Partner OAuth Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "Flutter App" as App
participant "LedgerGuard\nBackend" as LG
participant "Shopify\nPartners" as Shopify
participant "StateStore" as State
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Step 1: Initiate OAuth ==
Dev -> App: Click "Connect Shopify"
App -> LG: GET /oauth/authorize
activate LG
LG -> State: Store state with userID\n(10-min TTL, one-time use)
LG --> App: Redirect URL
deactivate LG
App -> Dev: Redirect to Shopify

== Step 2: User Authorizes ==
Dev -> Shopify: Approve scopes\n(read_financials, read_apps)
Shopify --> Dev: Redirect to callback\nwith code + state

== Step 3: Token Exchange ==
Dev -> LG: GET /oauth/callback?code=xxx&state=yyy
activate LG

LG -> State: Validate + consume state\n(CSRF protection)
State --> LG: userID (or reject)

LG -> Shopify: POST /access_token\n(code, client_id, client_secret)
Shopify --> LG: access_token

LG -> Shopify: POST GraphQL\nquery { currentUser { organizations } }
Shopify --> LG: organization_id

LG -> LG: Encrypt token\n(AES-256-GCM)

LG -> DB: INSERT partner_accounts\n(user_id, org_id, partner_id,\nencrypted_access_token)

LG --> Dev: Success redirect
deactivate LG

== Alternative: Manual Token ==
Dev -> App: Enter Partner API token
App -> LG: POST /api/v1/integrations/token
LG -> LG: Validate token\n(test API call)
LG -> LG: Encrypt (AES-256-GCM)
LG -> DB: INSERT partner_accounts

@enduml
